{
  "_": [
    "james_bond_pro on marty & jpsalas's 'BOND for VISUAL PINBALL X 10.7' 4.3 (bond.vpx, PAD-900):",
    "the same table as james_bond_le.shadow.json, on a Pro card. The table has no rocket",
    "VUK or physical rocket lock, no jet pack magnet, center lane diverter or back ramp",
    "post, as the Pro, whose locks are virtual: so the Pro is what Patch picks for it when",
    "both cards are there (`preferred`). Made from the LE map: every switch renumbered by",
    "its name through the Pro 1.06.0 program's own switch table (each sits on the same node",
    "and bit as the LE's; the Pro has none of the LE's tank hood, jetpack and rocket lock",
    "switches), the LE-only coils left out (the tribute's magnet stays its own), the lights",
    "as they are (the Pro's LEDs are where the LE's are) but the TANK HOOD insert, which the",
    "Pro has none of."
  ],
